  "details": "My avatar \n\nhttps://vrchat.com/home/avatar/avtr_c4eab967-8452-4b37-b7af-309accffd63e \n\nconstantly fails to generate an imposter. I have seen many other posts talking about similar issues but I can't actually tell if they're similar as vrchat has no error codes for failing to generate an imposter. I can't tell what's wrong and I've seen other people with the same base that could upload an imposter just fine. I think if a simple error code system was in  place I may be able to have more to go off of past \"it just won't generate\" but for now hat's literally all the info I can give on the situation.",
